.venv/

# seo/internal-links-suggested.json is NOT ignored. It stopped being advisory
# the moment gen/autolink.py started reading it: it is now a build input, and a
# build input that is not committed is a build that differs per machine.

# seo/triage-result.json is deliberately NOT ignored. The safety judgements are
# the record of which terms this business was cleared to target and which it was
# not, opportunities.py refuses to queue a term that has no judgement, and
# re-asking the same 120 questions every morning costs money to learn nothing.
